  'XCMG XE155UCR compact hydraulic excavator designed for urban construction and tight spaces. Features advanced hydraulic system, fuel-efficient Cummins engine, and excellent maneuverability. Engine: Cummins 4BTA3.9-C130 (80 kW / 109 HP). Max digging depth: 6.2 m. Max reach height: 9.8 m.': {"zh":"XCMG XE155UCR compact hydraulic excavator designed for urban construction and tight spaces. Features advanced hydraulic system, fuel-efficient Cummins engine, and excellent maneuverability. Engine: Cummins 4BTA3.9-C130 (80 kW / 109 HP). Max digging depth: 6.2 m. Max reach height: 9.8 m.","en":"XCMG XE155UCR compact hydraulic excavator designed for urban construction and tight spaces. Features advanced hydraulic system, fuel-efficient Cummins engine, and excellent maneuverability. Engine: Cummins 4BTA3.9-C130 (80 kW / 109 HP). Max digging depth: 6.2 m. Max reach height: 9.8 m.","es":"XCMG XE155UCR compact hydraulic excavator designed for urban construction and tight spaces. Features advanced hydraulic system, fuel-efficient Cummins engine, and excellent maneuverability. Engine: Cummins 4BTA3.9-C130 (80 kW / 109 HP). Max digging depth: 6.2 m. Max reach height: 9.8 m.","ar":"XCMG XE155UCR compact hydraulic excavator designed for urban construction and tight spaces. Features advanced hydraulic system, fuel-efficient Cummins engine, and excellent maneuverability. Engine: Cummins 4BTA3.9-C130 (80 kW / 109 HP). Max digging depth: 6.2 m. Max reach height: 9.8 m.","ru":"XCMG XE155UCR compact hydraulic excavator designed for urban construction and tight spaces. Features advanced hydraulic system, fuel-efficient Cummins engine, and excellent maneuverability. Engine: Cummins 4BTA3.9-C130 (80 kW / 109 HP). Max digging depth: 6.2 m. Max reach height: 9.8 m.","fr":"XCMG XE155UCR compact hydraulic excavator designed for urban construction and tight spaces. Features advanced hydraulic system, fuel-efficient Cummins engine, and excellent maneuverability. Engine: Cummins 4BTA3.9-C130 (80 kW / 109 HP). Max digging depth: 6.2 m. Max reach height: 9.8 m.","pt":"XCMG XE155UCR compact hydraulic excavator designed for urban construction and tight spaces. Features advanced hydraulic system, fuel-efficient Cummins engine, and excellent maneuverability. Engine: Cummins 4BTA3.9-C130 (80 kW / 109 HP). Max digging depth: 6.2 m. Max reach height: 9.8 m.","it":"XCMG XE155UCR compact hydraulic excavator designed for urban construction and tight spaces. Features advanced hydraulic system, fuel-efficient Cummins engine, and excellent maneuverability. Engine: Cummins 4BTA3.9-C130 (80 kW / 109 HP). Max digging depth: 6.2 m. Max reach height: 9.8 m."},
  'XCMG XE215DA mid-size hydraulic excavator for general construction and earthmoving. Features fuel-efficient Cummins engine, smooth hydraulic operation, and durable undercarriage. Engine: Cummins 6BTA5.9-C180 (122 kW / 165 HP). Max digging depth: 6.8 m. Max reach height: 10.4 m.': {"zh":"XCMG XE215DA mid-size hydraulic excavator for general construction and earthmoving. Features fuel-efficient Cummins engine, smooth hydraulic operation, and durable undercarriage. Engine: Cummins 6BTA5.9-C180 (122 kW / 165 HP). Max digging depth: 6.8 m. Max reach height: 10.4 m.","en":"XCMG XE215DA mid-size hydraulic excavator for general construction and earthmoving. Features fuel-efficient Cummins engine, smooth hydraulic operation, and durable undercarriage. Engine: Cummins 6BTA5.9-C180 (122 kW / 165 HP). Max digging depth: 6.8 m. Max reach height: 10.4 m.","es":"XCMG XE215DA mid-size hydraulic excavator for general construction and earthmoving. Features fuel-efficient Cummins engine, smooth hydraulic operation, and durable undercarriage. Engine: Cummins 6BTA5.9-C180 (122 kW / 165 HP). Max digging depth: 6.8 m. Max reach height: 10.4 m.","ar":"XCMG XE215DA mid-size hydraulic excavator for general construction and earthmoving. Features fuel-efficient Cummins engine, smooth hydraulic operation, and durable undercarriage. Engine: Cummins 6BTA5.9-C180 (122 kW / 165 HP). Max digging depth: 6.8 m. Max reach height: 10.4 m.","ru":"XCMG XE215DA mid-size hydraulic excavator for general construction and earthmoving. Features fuel-efficient Cummins engine, smooth hydraulic operation, and durable undercarriage. Engine: Cummins 6BTA5.9-C180 (122 kW / 165 HP). Max digging depth: 6.8 m. Max reach height: 10.4 m.","fr":"XCMG XE215DA mid-size hydraulic excavator for general construction and earthmoving. Features fuel-efficient Cummins engine, smooth hydraulic operation, and durable undercarriage. Engine: Cummins 6BTA5.9-C180 (122 kW / 165 HP). Max digging depth: 6.8 m. Max reach height: 10.4 m.","pt":"XCMG XE215DA mid-size hydraulic excavator for general construction and earthmoving. Features fuel-efficient Cummins engine, smooth hydraulic operation, and durable undercarriage. Engine: Cummins 6BTA5.9-C180 (122 kW / 165 HP). Max digging depth: 6.8 m. Max reach height: 10.4 m.","it":"XCMG XE215DA mid-size hydraulic excavator for general construction and earthmoving. Features fuel-efficient Cummins engine, smooth hydraulic operation, and durable undercarriage. Engine: Cummins 6BTA5.9-C180 (122 kW / 165 HP). Max digging depth: 6.8 m. Max reach height: 10.4 m."},
